# 從頭再嚟
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:由頭開始，重新做過。通常指之前嘅嘗試失敗咗，要重新開始。
eng:start over; begin again
<eg>
yue:今次考試唔合格，唯有從頭再嚟。 (gam1 ci3 kao3 si1 m4 ho3 gok3, wai4 jau5 cung4 tau4 zoi3 lai4.)
eng:I failed the exam this time, so I have to start over.

<eg>
yue:呢個項目搞到一鑊，不如從頭再嚟算。 (ni1 go3 seung6 muk6 gong2 dou3 jat1 wok6, bat1 yu4 cung4 tau4 zoi3 lai4 syun3.)
eng:This project is a mess, let's just start over.
```
 [end of text]


